Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:58:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ws: talk through the camera speaker over a WebSocket

GET /talk/{camera}?rate=<Hz> takes binary frames of PCM s16le mono (a browser
microphone), encodes them to the camera's ADPCM with GStreamer and streams
them to talk_stream; "stop" or closing ends it. The last message is
{"ok": true} or {"ok": false, "error": busy|no_speaker|unreachable|failed}.
talk_config() is shared with the talk subcommand.
---
